###############################################################################
# Line endings.
#
# The tree is LF. Several scripts were committed with mixed endings, per line,
# and because git compares bytes, every edit to one of them read as a change to
# every line in the file: the flag work touched about sixty lines and the diff
# showed fourteen hundred. That is what made the change unreviewable, so the
# endings are stated here rather than left to whichever tool last saved a file.
###############################################################################
* text=auto eol=lf

# Unity rewrites these on save and imports them by content, so a normalisation
# pass over them would churn every scene and prefab in the project for nothing.
*.meta -text
*.unity -text
*.prefab -text
*.asset -text

# Unity's own library and generated project files are not source.
[Ll]ibrary/ -text -diff
[Tt]emp/ -text -diff
[Oo]bj/ -text -diff
[Ll]ogs/ -text -diff
[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/ -text -diff
*.csproj -text -diff
*.sln -text -diff
